            0.153,
            0.522,
            0.447,
            0.548
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4.2 Visualising Solids"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.557,
            0.494,
            0.579
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Build it in Your Imagination"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.589,
            0.847,
            0.648
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ We will start this section by practising visualisation. For each prompt, feel free to talk to your partner, gesture, draw it in the air — but do not actually draw on paper!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.667,
            0.635,
            0.762
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "My method is different. I do not rush into actual work. When I get an idea I start at once building it up in my imagination. I change the construction, make improvements, and operate the device entirely in my mind."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.766,
            0.634,
            0.841
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Nikolas Tesla (1856 – 1943), the great Serbian-American engineer and inventor, who made fundamental contributions to electrical engineering and other fields."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.651,
            0.665,
            0.825,
            0.841
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
